{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43117","headline":"中秋夜不见月 · 元凛","name":"中秋夜不见月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟾轮何事色全微，赚得佳人出绣帏。\n四野雾凝空寂寞，九霄云锁绝光辉。\n吟诗得句翻停笔，翫处临尊却掩扉。\n公子倚栏犹怅望，嬾将红烛草堂归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元凛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}